<title>USA: AMEX to trade options on GDRs of Ashanti.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade options on GDRs of Ashanti.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Monday it would trade options on Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs) of Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd from April 4.</p>
<p>The options would open with strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2, with position limits of 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The GDRs ended down 3/8 at 13-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>Initial expiration months for the Ashanti options have been set for April, May, August and November.</p>
<p>Charlton, Goin, SLK has been named the specialist for the options, the AMEX said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
